              ridden  by LLCC__AALLLL or more specific environment variables such as
              LLCC__CCOOLLLLAATTEE, LLCC__CCTTYYPPEE, LLCC__MMEESSSSAAGGEESS, LLCC__MMOONNEETTAARRYY, LLCC__NNUUMMEERRIICC,  and
              LLCC__TTIIMMEE  (see llooccaallee(7) for further details of the LLCC__** environ‐
              ment variables).

